Package: rrpruntime
Type: Package
Title: Implementation-Neutral Readmission Runtime
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Readmission Risk Pool", "Maintainers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainers@invalid.example")
Author: Readmission Risk Pool Maintainers [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Readmission Risk Pool Maintainers <maintainers@invalid.example>
Description: Focused internal runtime primitives for admitted canonical input,
    temporal eligibility, episode-state construction, and provider-neutral
    estimand requests, controlled provider registration and execution, and
    standardized estimate conformance, and backend-independent operational
    history ports. It performs no source mapping, durable storage, decision
    policy, product construction, application work, or deployment.
